          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "truck",
            "heading": "<em>Shipping Information</em>",
            "text": "<p>Free next-day tracked delivery for all spas via DPD, with an option for Saturday delivery available for an extra £9.99. Upon dispatch, DPD will provide you with a one-hour tracking window.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "text",
